# Canonical author-name mapping for git log / GitHub display.
#
# Format: <correct-name> <correct-email> <commit-name> <commit-email>
#
# All work in this repository is by Anton Sokolov. The two
# 2026-05-13 genesis-ceremony commits (21c4213 and e5de797) were
# authored with "Anton Eremin" as the configured user.name on the
# operator's workstation at the time; the email was correct
# (info@h2oatlas.ee). This .mailmap normalises the display name
# without rewriting commit history.
#
# Additional mappings normalise the maintainer's other commit
# identities (sapsan14 GitHub no-reply, dev@tyche.institute org
# identity, sokolovmeister@gmail.com personal) to the same canonical
# name so `git shortlog -sn` and the GitHub contributors page do not
# fragment one human into multiple entries.

Anton Sokolov <info@h2oatlas.ee> Anton Eremin <info@h2oatlas.ee>
Anton Sokolov <info@h2oatlas.ee> Anton Sokolov <sapsan14@users.noreply.github.com>
